{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Time to Eat", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe personal and regional eating habits and cooking in a range of communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are many ways to talk about the future. Generally, there are four verb tenses you can use, each specific to a particular situation.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Function</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will + infinitive</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">be going to + infinitive</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">intention</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I'll give you a ride to the shop.</span><br><br>(decided at the time of speaking: spontaneous offers, promises, decisions)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I can't help you on Saturday. I'm going to help my girlfriend move into her new apartment  .</span><br><br>(decided before the time of speaking, but not yet fully planned)\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">prediction</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I think you'll find this book very interesting.</span><br><br>(based on personal judgment, opinion or intuition)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My sister is going to have a baby.</span><br><br>(based on present evidence or the predicted event is very near and is sure to happen)\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">arrangements</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm flying to Paris on the 23rd of this month.</span><br><br>(plans and arrangements have been made)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The boat leaves at 7 a.m. every morning.</span><br><br>(this is a regularly scheduled departure)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Respond Politely to Suggestions and Offers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely.<br><br>Remember to  use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions:<br><ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li> <li>You should \u2026 </li> <li>You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Offering Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Would you like \u2026 ?</li><li>Can I get you \u2026 ?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li><li> I guess that could ...</li><li> That would be \u2026</li><li> I would ...</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Would you like a drink?<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I could do with a glass of wine, please. <br><span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Can I get you a bottle of beer? <br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Beer would be great, thank you.<br>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hold the fort", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take care of something temporarily ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to hold the fort while you battle with that pulled pork.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use before your party starts.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to battle ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to handle; to resist something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to battle with that pulled pork!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cleaver ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large knife used to cut meat ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This cleaver is very useful to chop meat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "determined", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having made a decision and resolved not to change it ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You look very determined with that cleaver in your hand.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take the edge off ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to reduce the effect of something unpleasant  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A glass of wine should take the edge off that stress.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to freak out ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become irrationally nervous ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll get the door. Don't freak out!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "the finishing touch ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the final detail completing a piece of work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to put the finishing touches on the poutine and the pulled pork.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and find information on a professional kitchen in a restaurant or a hotel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out about the different items and utensils used in the kitchen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out how much food is prepared in a professional kitchen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a description of the kitchen (10-12 lines).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your description aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about how to prepare food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about amounts and quantities.", "type": "text"}, {